# Bob-omb Battlefield: turn, run into the first Goomba (Mario loses a health
# wedge and is knocked back): the object interaction path of the physics check.
# Timed in GAME frames (mgba_runner --keys-game), so the route doesn't move
# when the demo's frame rate changes. The nudge works anywhere in 40..100.
0 7 >
7 60 ^
60 61 ^>
61 300 ^
